 Cake"},{"n":114,"t":"---"},{"n":115,"t":"Difficulty  |"},{"n":116,"t":""},{"n":117,"t":"【4†Cookbook】 | 【48†Recipes】 | 【49†Ingredients】 | 【50†Equipment】 | 【51†Techniques】 | 【52†Cookbook Disambiguation Pages】 | 【53†Recipes】 | 【54†Dessert】 | 【55†Cake】"},{"n":118,"t":"Sponge cake is a common type of 【55†cake】 that can be made by a couple different methods. This method uses oil and yeast, which avoids separating or whipping eggs. Note that this recipe does not preheat the oven—this slower heating will provide extra time for the yeast to rise."},{"n":119,"t":"## Ingredients"},{"n":120,"t":""},{"n":121,"t":"[【56†edit】 | 【57†edit source】]"},{"n":122,"t":""},{"n":123,"t":"  * 5 【58†eggs】"},{"n":124,"t":"  * 90 【59†g】 white granulated 【60†sugar】 (adjust amount to taste)"},{"n":125,"t":"  * 90 g 【61†vegetable oil】"},{"n":126,"t":"  * 20 【62†ml】 【63†milk】 (adjust amount to taste)"},{"n":127,"t":"  * 150 g 【64†all-purpose flour】, 【65†sifted】"},{"n":128,"t":"  * 8 g instant 【66†yeast】"},{"n":129,"t":"  * A dash of 【67†vanilla extract】 (adjust to taste, optional)"},{"n":130,"t":"  * Hot water (70°C/158°F)"},{"n":131,"t":"## Equipment"},{"n":132,"t":""},{"n":133,"t":"[【68†edit】 | 【69†edit source】]"},{"n":134,"t":""},{"n":135,"t":"  * 1 large 【70†mixing bowl】"},{"n":136,"t":"  * 1 shallow baking tray"},{"n":137,"t":"  * 1 【71†cake pan】"},{"n":138,"t":"  * 【72†Whisk】"},{"n":139,"t":"  * 【73†Sieve】"},{"n":140,"t":"  * 【74†Baking paper】"},{"n":141,"t":"  * 【75†Oven】"},{"n":142,"t":"  * Measuring cups and spoons"},{"n":143,"t":"  * Kitchen 【76†scale】"},{"n":144,"t":"## Procedure"},{"n":145,"t":""},{"n":146,"t":"[【77†edit】 | 【78†edit source】]"},{"n":147,"t":""},{"n":148,"t":"  1. Crack the eggs into the mixing bowl, and beat them to homogenize."},{"n":149,"t":""},{"n":150,"t":"  2. Mix in the sugar until well-distributed."},{"n":151,"t":""},{"n":152,"t":"  3. Mix in the oil, then the milk."},{"n":153,"t":""},{"n":154,"t":"  4. 【65†Sift】 in the flour, and mix just until incorporated."},{"n":155,"t":""},{"n":156,"t":"  5. Mix in the yeast powder."},{"n":157,"t":""},{"n":158,"t":"  6. Transfer the batter to a cake pan lined with baking paper. Place the cake pan into the larger baking tray, and place them into the oven."},{"n":159,"t":"  7. Pour the hot water into the larger baking tray to make a water bath about 1–2 cm deep."},{"n":160,"t":"  8. Set the oven to 【79†150°C】, and bake for 65 minutes or until a skewer inserted into the center comes out with no batter on it."},{"n":161,"t":"  9. Remove the cake pan, and let it cool."},{"n":162,"t":"  10. Unmold the cake, and cut into squares."},{"n":163,"t":"## Notes, tips, and variations"},{"n":164,"t":""},{"n":165,"t":"[【80†edit】 | 【81†edit source】]"},{"n":166,"t":""},{"n":167,"t":"  * To make a matcha version:Matcha variation"},{"n":168,"t":"    * Increase the sugar from 90 g to 120 g."},{"n":169,"t":"    * Combine the milk with 20 ml brewed milk tea and 12 g 【82†matcha】 powder before mixing into the batter."},{"n":170,"t":""},{"n":171,"t":"【83†Image】"},{"n":172,"t":""},{"n":173,"t":"Retrieved from \"【30†https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Yeasted_Vanilla_Sponge_Cake&oldid=4516973】\""},{"n":174,"t":""},{"n":175,"t":"【84†Categories】:"},{"n":176,"t":"  * 【85†Easy recipes】"},{"n":177,"t":"  * 【53†Recipes】"},{"n":178,"t":"  * 【86†Recipes for cake】"},{"n":179,"t":"  * 【87†English recipes】"},{"n":180,"t":"  * 【88†Baking recipes】"},{"n":181,"t":"  * 【89†Recipes using egg】"},{"n":182,"t":"  * 【90†Dessert recipes】"},{"n":183,"t":"  * 【91†Recipes using yeast】"},{"n":184,"t":"  * 【92†Recipes using brown sugar】"},{"n":185,"t":"  * 【93†Recipes using all-purpose flour】"},{"n":186,"t":"  * 【94†Recipes using granulated sugar】"},{"n":187,"t":"  * 【95†Recipes using milk】"},{"n":188,"t":"  * 【96†Recipes using vanilla】"},{"n":189,"t":"  * 【97†Recipes using vegetable oil】"},{"n":190,"t":""},{"n":191,"t":"Hidden categories:"},{"n":192,"t":"  * 【98†Recipes with images】"},{"n":193,"t":"  * 【99†Recipes without 